From 99dec7997fdad652b45623bc3fa2b6f6e659b754 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: ruscher <teste@hemofilia.org.br>
Date: Mon, 26 Oct 2026 23:23:46 -0300
Subject: [PATCH 48/48] dock: Keeps a main tile on the Dock, restores default
 launchers.

Like Window Maker's Dock: The Dock has a main tile nearest its anchor,
which can't be removed. Before, removing every launcher left 'Launchers
= ();' in the state and an empty, invisible Dock: Nothing to right-click
or drag anymore. The main tile shows the Dock's 'Icon' (a path, or a name
in wlmaker/icons; default from CMake WLMDOCK_DEFAULT_ICON, else the new
dock-56x56.png, the wlmaker logo). Its menu moves the Dock to the other
side or end, and restores the default launchers (see
wlmaker_state_load_defaults; 'wlmdock --default_state_file' overrides).
The launchers' menu is Launch, Kill, Remove. The Clip's menu restores the
Clip's default launchers, too: wlmdock re-reads its launchers on SIGUSR1,
along with its position. Launchers that fail to load (eg. a missing icon)
are left out, instead of ending wlmdock.

The menu items of Clip, Dock and dock-apps are translated (pt_BR).

Unit test for the main tile.
